WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.735
Hopian: Welcome back, you three!

2
00:00:14.736 --> 00:00:16.575
Bello: Heroes!

3
00:00:16.576 --> 00:00:21.107
Danny: They made these special medals just for us.

4
00:00:21.108 --> 00:00:26.619
Tina: The normal medals are too heavy!

5
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.236
Hopian: So did you have a busy day with the governor?

6
00:00:30.237 --> 00:00:32.779
Danny: Did we ever!

7
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:37.240
Brad: The governor introduced us to the most famous giants in the land!

8
00:00:37.241 --> 00:00:40.941
Brad: I met Brainiac, the famous scientist!

9
00:00:40.942 --> 00:00:44.008
Tina: We got to see your best soccer team practice.

10
00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:47.071
Tina: Ginormous United is great!

11
00:00:47.072 --> 00:00:49.272
Hopian: I'm a big fan!

12
00:00:49.273 --> 00:00:52.072
Did you meet Dribbello?

13
00:00:52.073 --> 00:00:54.680
Tina: He autographed a shirt for me!

14
00:00:54.681 --> 00:00:56.256
Tina: You should have it.

15
00:00:56.257 --> 00:00:58.544
It's too big for me.

16
00:00:58.545 --> 00:01:04.146
Hopian: That's so exciting! Thank you.

17
00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:07.393
Danny: I have to say, I'm pretty tired though.

18
00:01:07.394 --> 00:01:10.857
Brad: Yes. It's hard work being a hero.

19
00:01:10.858 --> 00:01:13.974
Tina: And I miss my family.

20
00:01:13.975 --> 00:01:17.805
Hopian: I guess that means it's time for you to go.

21
00:01:17.806 --> 00:01:21.577
Bello: Wait.

22
00:01:21.578 --> 00:01:24.145
Brad: We haven't left yet, Bello.

23
00:01:24.146 --> 00:01:27.585
Hopian: I think he has something to show you.

24
00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:30.620
Bello: Picture.

25
00:01:30.621 --> 00:01:34.195
Hopian: Bello, that's a beautiful painting!

26
00:01:34.196 --> 00:01:37.554
Danny: Wow. You're really good at drawing, Bello.

27
00:01:37.555 --> 00:01:39.853
Tina: It's really nice!

28
00:01:39.854 --> 00:01:46.818
Brad: Hey, Danny. You're not the only one who likes art class!

29
00:01:46.819 --> 00:01:48.347
Bello: Tina.

30
00:01:48.348 --> 00:01:50.935
Tina: That's right, Bello!

31
00:01:50.936 --> 00:01:52.237
Bello: Brad.

32
00:01:52.238 --> 00:01:55.143
Brad: That's right, that's me!

33
00:01:55.144 --> 00:01:56.538
Bello: Danny.

34
00:01:56.539 --> 00:01:58.901
Danny: When did you learn our names?

35
00:01:58.902 --> 00:02:07.172
Bello: Bello. Danny. Tina. Brad. Friends.

36
00:02:07.173 --> 00:02:12.496
Danny: Hopian, Bello sure helped us a lot.

37
00:02:12.497 --> 00:02:14.975
Hopian: He's a very good boy.

38
00:02:14.976 --> 00:02:17.350
I'm very proud of him.

39
00:02:17.351 --> 00:02:20.117
Bello: Dada.

40
00:02:20.118 --> 00:02:23.656
Danny: I guess . . . I guess we're done here.

41
00:02:23.657 --> 00:02:27.259
Tina: Yeah. We should go back to school.

42
00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:30.293
Hopian: I can't thank you enough, children.

43
00:02:30.294 --> 00:02:33.794
Danny: Well, you can do one last thing for us.

44
00:02:33.795 --> 00:02:35.652
Hopian: Anything.

45
00:02:35.653 --> 00:02:38.889
Danny: You can tell us how to get home.

46
00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:41.614
Hopian: Use your imagination, children.

47
00:02:41.615 --> 00:02:44.482
How do you think you can get home?

48
00:02:44.483 --> 00:02:48.211
Tina: The rainbow. The rainbow will get us home.

49
00:02:48.212 --> 00:02:51.312
Hopian: Why do you say that, Tina?

50
00:02:51.313 --> 00:02:54.405
Tina: The rainbow key was how we got to Ginormous.

51
00:02:54.406 --> 00:02:58.109
Tina: And a rainbow was the key to defeating Tristay.

52
00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.528
Hopian: That's right, Tina.

53
00:03:00.529 --> 00:03:09.573
The rainbow is the key.
